(1, NULL, NULL, 'ws-blossom-skirt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, '1|1'),
(2, NULL, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 27, '1|27'),
(3, 'en', NULL, 'Blossom Breeze Cotton Printed Short Skirt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 2, 'en|1|2'),
(4, 'en', NULL, 'Embrace the playful elegance of our Blossom Breeze Cotton Printed Short Skirt. Crafted from high-quality cotton fabric and adorned with a delightful print, this skirt is perfect for those seeking a blend of comfort and style in their summer wardrobe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 9, 'en|1|9'),
(5, 'en', NULL, '<p>Introducing the Blossom Breeze Cotton Printed Short Skirt, a charming addition to your summer wardrobe. Made from premium quality cotton, this skirt offers a soft and breathable feel, ensuring comfort all day long. The delightful print features blossoms and intricate patterns, adding a touch of playfulness to your ensemble.</p><br><p>The A-line silhouette of the Blossom Breeze skirt is designed to provide a flattering fit, accentuating your curves in all the right ways. The length is just perfect, offering a balance between style and ease of movement, making it ideal for casual outings, picnics, or a day at the beach.</p><br><p>Pair this skirt with a simple tank top or a cropped blouse to complete the look. Add sandals and minimal accessories for a laid-back summer vibe or dress it up with wedges and statement jewelry for a more elevated appearance. The Blossom Breeze Cotton Printed Short Skirt is a versatile piece that effortlessly adapts to your style and the occasion.</p><br><p>Experience the epitome of summer fashion with our Blossom Breeze Cotton Printed Short Skirt. Let the vibrant print and comfortable fabric make a statement as you embrace the sun-kissed season with confidence and style.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 10, 'en|1|10'),
