(449, 'en', NULL, 'Experience the perfect balance of comfort and style with our EverFresh Men\'s Wrinkle-Free Half Sleeve Cotton Tee. Crafted from premium 100% cotton, this tee features anti-shrink technology, ensuring a lasting fit. Stay neat and sharp all day with the wrinkle-free feature. A must-have for your casual and versatile wardrobe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24, 9, 'en|24|9'),
(450, 'en', NULL, '<p>Introducing EverFresh Men\'s Wrinkle-Free Half Sleeve Cotton Tee, a testament to uncompromised comfort and a well-groomed appearance. Made from 100% premium cotton, this tee offers a luxurious softness against your skin and promotes breathability, making it an ideal choice for your daily wear.</p><br><p>The wrinkle-free technology ensures that your tee remains crisp and neat throughout the day, allowing you to maintain a polished look effortlessly. Additionally, the anti-shrink feature guarantees that the tee retains its original fit even after numerous washes, providing you with a long-lasting favorite.</p><br><p>The half sleeves offer versatility, making this tee suitable for a wide range of occasions and weather. The classic design makes it a timeless wardrobe essential that pairs effortlessly with jeans, shorts, or your favorite bottoms.</p><br><p>Elevate your comfort and style with EverFresh Men\'s Wrinkle-Free Half Sleeve Cotton Tee. Experience a tee that doesn\'t compromise on quality, giving you the confidence to conquer your day in a sharp and refined manner.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24, 10, 'en|24|10'),
