(981, 'en', NULL, 'Experience timeless style and comfort with the Azure Comfort Full Sleeve T-Shirt. This stylish blue t-shirt features a sleek design without a collar, making it perfect for both casual and smart-casual occasions. Crafted from a soft and breathable cotton blend, it ensures all-day comfort and versatility for layering and year-round wear.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 51, 9, 'en|51|9'),
(982, 'en', NULL, '<p>The Azure Comfort Full Sleeve T-Shirt is a testament to timeless style and versatility for your wardrobe.</p><br><p>This t-shirt is designed for individuals who appreciate a classic and sleek look. The absence of a collar adds a touch of modernity, making it suitable for various occasions, whether you\'re going for a casual or smart-casual vibe.</p><br><p>The stylish blue hue complements a wide range of looks and color combinations, allowing you to mix and match with ease. Whether you pair it with jeans, shorts, or layer it under a jacket, this t-shirt effortlessly adapts to your style.</p><br><p>Comfort is key, and this t-shirt delivers with a soft and breathable cotton blend. It\'s perfect for all-day wear, ensuring that you feel relaxed and at ease throughout your day.</p><br><p>The design is both classic and timeless, making it a versatile addition to your wardrobe. It\'s ideal for year-round wear, and its simplicity allows you to create different looks with ease.</p><br><p>Experience timeless style and comfort with the Azure Comfort Full Sleeve T-Shirt. This t-shirt is more than just clothing; it\'s a reflection of your appreciation for classic style and comfort. Let it be your go-to choice for various occasions, whether you\'re heading to work, meeting friends, or just enjoying a relaxed day out.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 51, 10, 'en|51|10'),
