(1034, 'en', NULL, 'Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans-28', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54, 2, 'en|54|2'),
(1035, 'en', NULL, 'Elevate your casual style with Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans. These stylish jeans feature a modern and versatile grey design, perfect for various occasions. With a comfortable fit and a touch of stretch, they provide ease of movement. The classic five-pocket style and durable denim ensure a timeless look and long-lasting wear.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54, 9, 'en|54|9'),
(1036, 'en', NULL, '<p>Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans are the epitome of modern style, comfort, and versatility.</p><br><p>These grey denim jeans are designed to be your go-to choice for various occasions. The stylish grey design adds a contemporary and versatile touch to your wardrobe, making it suitable for both casual and semi-casual events.</p><br><p>Comfort is a top priority, and these jeans deliver. They provide a comfortable fit with a touch of stretch, allowing you to move freely and confidently throughout your day. Whether you\'re heading to work, meeting friends, or simply enjoying a day out, these jeans keep you at ease.</p><br><p>The classic five-pocket style is not just about function; it adds a timeless look to your outfit. You can easily pair these jeans with a t-shirt for a relaxed look or dress them up with a button-down shirt for a semi-casual appearance.</p><br><p>Crafted from high-quality denim, these jeans are designed for long-lasting wear. They can withstand everyday use and maintain their stylish appeal.</p><br><p>Elevate your casual style with Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans. These jeans are more than just clothing; they are a reflection of your modern and versatile fashion sense. Let them be your trusted choice for various occasions, ensuring that you look stylish, comfortable, and confident in any setting.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 54, 10, 'en|54|10'),
