(2331, 'en', NULL, '<p>Make your next event unforgettable by booking the <strong>Grand Royal Hall</strong>, a premier venue designed for celebrations of all kinds. Whether you’re hosting a wedding, corporate event, birthday party, or community gathering, the <strong>Grand Royal Hall</strong> provides the perfect setting with its elegant design, spacious layout, and modern amenities.</p><br><p>Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual systems, ample seating arrangements, and customizable décor options, this hall offers everything you need to create a memorable experience. Our dedicated staff ensures a seamless event, from the booking process to the final farewell, allowing you to focus on enjoying the occasion.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 121, 10, 'en|121|10'),
