(2420, 'en', NULL, '<p>Enjoy crispy, guilt-free meals with this 4.5-liter digital air fryer featuring adjustable temperature control and rapid air technology.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 126, 9, 'en|126|9'),
(2421, 'en', NULL, '<p>&nbsp;Upgrade your kitchen with the Digital Air Fryer &ndash; the perfect solution for healthier cooking. Using rapid air circulation technology, it allows you to fry, bake, grill, and roast with little to no oil. The sleek touch control panel makes operation simple, while the 4.5L non-stick basket offers ample space for family-sized meals. With adjustable temperature settings and a built-in timer, you can customize cooking to suit a variety of dishes. Cleanup is easy thanks to the dishwasher-safe basket and compact, space-saving design.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 126, 10, 'en|126|10'),
