(2437, 'en', NULL, '20L Solo Microwave Oven with Manual Controls', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 127, 2, 'en|127|2'),
(2438, 'en', NULL, '<p>Compact 20-liter solo microwave oven ideal for reheating, defrosting, and basic cooking tasks with simple manual controls.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 127, 9, 'en|127|9'),
(2439, 'en', NULL, '<p>The 20L Solo Microwave Oven offers a quick and convenient way to reheat, defrost, and cook everyday meals. Designed with user-friendly manual knobs, it gives you easy control over time and power levels. Its compact size fits neatly into any kitchen while still offering enough capacity for small to medium-sized dishes. Perfect for singles, couples, or small families, this microwave features a durable build, energy efficiency, and even heating technology. Whether you&rsquo;re warming up leftovers or preparing a quick snack, it delivers reliable performance every time.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 127, 10, 'en|127|10'),
