(2456, 'en', NULL, '<p>Sleek and lightweight 10.1\" tablet featuring an octa-core processor, 64GB storage, dual cameras, and a long-lasting battery&mdash;perfect for work, entertainment, and learning on the go.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 128, 9, 'en|128|9'),
(2457, 'en', NULL, '<p data-start=\"437\" data-end=\"1094\">Stay connected and productive with this 10.1-inch Android tablet, designed for performance and portability. Powered by an efficient octa-core processor and 4GB RAM, it delivers smooth multitasking whether you\'re browsing, streaming, or working on documents. The vibrant HD display ensures crisp visuals for videos, games, or reading, while 64GB of internal storage (expandable via microSD) provides ample space for apps, media, and files.<br data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"878\">Dual cameras let you video call and capture memories, and the long-lasting battery keeps you going throughout the day. Lightweight and compact, it\'s perfect for students, professionals, and entertainment on the move.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 128, 10, 'en|128|10'),
