(2588, 'en', NULL, '<p>Elevate your professional presence with our Executive Elegance Men\'s Formal Office Suit. Meticulously tailored from premium fabrics with impeccable attention to detail, this suit delivers a polished and authoritative look for boardrooms, business meetings, and formal occasions.</p>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135, 9, 'en|135|9'),
(2589, 'en', NULL, '<p>Introducing the Executive Elegance Men\'s Formal Office Suit, the embodiment of professional sophistication. Crafted from a premium polyester-viscose blend with a smooth satin lining, this suit offers both comfort and durability throughout the workday.</p><br><p>The two-button single-breasted jacket features notch lapels, a chest pocket, and two front flap pockets, while the straight-fit trousers complete the streamlined silhouette. Available in classic colors, this suit transitions seamlessly from office hours to evening events.</p><br><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Premium polyester-viscose blend fabric</li><li>Smooth satin interior lining</li><li>Two-button single-breasted jacket</li><li>Notch lapels with chest and flap pockets</li><li>Straight-fit matching trousers</li><li>Available in Green and Blue</li></ul>', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 135, 10, 'en|135|10'),
