(29, 'ks-trendsetter-shoes', 'configurable', '', 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes', 'Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes. These stylish and designer shoes are perfect for young individuals who want to make a fashion statement while staying active. Designed for sports, active pursuits, and everyday adventures, they offer comfort, durability, and a secure fit with a lace-up closure.', '<p>Introducing our Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes, a pair of footwear designed for the young fashion-forward individuals who are always on the move.</p><br><p>These running shoes are not your average pair; they are a fashion statement in themselves. Designed with a stylish and trendsetting look, they empower young boys to express their unique style while enjoying their active pursuits. Whether it\'s sports, running, or everyday adventures, these shoes are made to match the energy and style of young trendsetters.</p><br><p>Comfort is key, and these shoes ensure that young boys can stay active for hours without discomfort. The high-quality synthetic leather and mesh materials guarantee that these shoes withstand the wear and tear of active and adventurous young lives.</p><br><p>The lace-up closure not only provides a secure fit but also allows for adjustability, so young individuals can customize the fit to their liking.</p><br><p>Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes. These shoes are more than just footwear; they are a reflection of individuality, style, and the desire to stand out in the crowd. Let the young trendsetters make a fashion statement with each step they take, embracing both fashion and an active lifestyle.</p>', 'young-trendsetter-boys-designer-and-fashionable-running-shoes', 1, 1, 1, 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes', 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes, kids shoes, boys shoes, girls shoes, children footwear, school shoes, casual shoes, sports shoes, young, trendsetter, designer, fashionable', 'Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes. These stylish and designer shoes are perfect for young individuals who want to make a fashion statement while staying active.', 0.0000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:17', 'en', 'default', 6, 15, '2026-08-01 19:41:17', NULL, 1),
(30, 'ks-trendsetter-shoes', 'configurable', '', 'أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار', 'امنح جيل الغد القوة مع أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار. هذه الأحذية الأنيقة مثالية لمن يريد التميز في الموضة أثناء النشاط. مصممة للرياضة والمغامرات اليومية، توفر الراحة والمتانة وتثبيت آمن برباط.', '<p>نقدم لكم أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار، حذاء مصمم للأولاد الذين يحبون الموضة والحركة.</p><br><p>هذه الأحذية ليست عادية؛ إنها بيان للموضة بحد ذاتها. تصميم عصري يمنح الأولاد فرصة التعبير عن أسلوبهم الفريد أثناء النشاط. سواء في الرياضة أو الجري أو المغامرات اليومية، هذه الأحذية تناسب طاقة وأسلوب الأولاد العصريين.</p><br><p>الراحة أساسية، وهذه الأحذية تضمن النشاط لساعات دون تعب. المواد عالية الجودة تضمن المتانة.</p><br><p>الإغلاق برباط يوفر تثبيتًا آمنًا وقابلًا للتعديل حسب الرغبة.</p><br><p>امنح جيل الغد القوة مع أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار. إنها أكثر من مجرد حذاء؛ إنها انعكاس للتميز والرغبة في البروز.</p>', 'young-trendsetter-boys-designer-and-fashionable-running-shoes', 1, 1, 1, 'أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار', 'أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار, أحذية أطفال, أحذية أولاد, أحذية بنات, أحذية مدرسية, أحذية رياضية, أحذية عصرية, أولاد, مصمم, عصري', 'امنح جيل الغد القوة مع أحذية الجري المصممة والعصرية للأولاد الصغار. هذه الأحذية الأنيقة مثالية لمن يريد التميز في الموضة أثناء النشاط.', 0.0000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:17', 'ar', 'default', 6, 15, '2026-08-01 19:41:17', NULL, 1),
(31, 'ks-trendsetter-shoes-red-5-7y', 'simple', '', 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes-Red', 'Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes. These stylish and designer shoes are perfect for young individuals who want to make a fashion statement while staying active. Designed for sports, active pursuits, and everyday adventures, they offer comfort, durability, and a secure fit with a lace-up closure.', '<p>Introducing our Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes, a pair of footwear designed for the young fashion-forward individuals who are always on the move.</p><br><p>These running shoes are not your average pair; they are a fashion statement in themselves. Designed with a stylish and trendsetting look, they empower young boys to express their unique style while enjoying their active pursuits. Whether it\'s sports, running, or everyday adventures, these shoes are made to match the energy and style of young trendsetters.</p><br><p>Comfort is key, and these shoes ensure that young boys can stay active for hours without discomfort. The high-quality synthetic leather and mesh materials guarantee that these shoes withstand the wear and tear of active and adventurous young lives.</p><br><p>The lace-up closure not only provides a secure fit but also allows for adjustability, so young individuals can customize the fit to their liking.</p><br><p>Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes. These shoes are more than just footwear; they are a reflection of individuality, style, and the desire to stand out in the crowd. Let the young trendsetters make a fashion statement with each step they take, embracing both fashion and an active lifestyle.</p>', 'YOUNGTRENDSETTERBOYS2023-variant-1-12', 0, 0, 1, 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes-Red', 'Young Trendsetter Boys\' Designer and Fashionable Running Shoes, kids shoes, boys shoes, girls shoes, children footwear, school shoes, casual shoes, sports shoes, young, trendsetter, designer, fashionable', 'Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter boys\' running shoes—stylish, designer-inspired, and comfortable for active everyday wear.', 74.9900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:17', 'en', 'default', 6, 16, '2026-08-01 19:41:18', NULL, 0),
