r and Fashionable Running Shoes, kids shoes, boys shoes, girls shoes, children footwear, school shoes, casual shoes, sports shoes, young, trendsetter, designer, fashionable', 'Empower the trendsetters of tomorrow with Young Trendsetter boys\' running shoes—stylish, lightweight, and comfortable for active everyday wear.', 74.9900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:18', 'en', 'default', 6, 17, '2026-08-01 19:41:18', NULL, 0),
