chnology, ensuring a lasting fit. Stay neat and sharp all day with the wrinkle-free feature. A must-have for your casual and versatile wardrobe.', 42.9900, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:19', 'en', 'default', 3, 26, '2026-08-01 19:41:21', NULL, 0),
