(111, 'mj-urbanslate-jeans-w32', 'simple', '', 'Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans-32', 'Elevate your casual style with Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans. These stylish jeans feature a modern and versatile grey design, perfect for various occasions. With a comfortable fit and a touch of stretch, they provide ease of movement. The classic five-pocket style and durable denim ensure a timeless look and long-lasting wear.', '<p>Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans are the epitome of modern style, comfort, and versatility.</p><br><p>These grey denim jeans are designed to be your go-to choice for various occasions. The stylish grey design adds a contemporary and versatile touch to your wardrobe, making it suitable for both casual and semi-casual events.</p><br><p>Comfort is a top priority, and these jeans deliver. They provide a comfortable fit with a touch of stretch, allowing you to move freely and confidently throughout your day. Whether you\'re heading to work, meeting friends, or simply enjoying a day out, these jeans keep you at ease.</p><br><p>The classic five-pocket style is not just about function; it adds a timeless look to your outfit. You can easily pair these jeans with a t-shirt for a relaxed look or dress them up with a button-down shirt for a semi-casual appearance.</p><br><p>Crafted from high-quality denim, these jeans are designed for long-lasting wear. They can withstand everyday use and maintain their stylish appeal.</p>', 'urban-slate-mens-grey-denim-jeans-32', 1, 1, 1, 'Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans-32', 'Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans-32, men jeans, denim jeans, slim fit, casual jeans, men denim, men fashion, urban, slate, grey, denim, size 32', 'Elevate your casual style with Urban Slate Men\'s Grey Denim Jeans. Modern grey design, comfortable fit with a touch of stretch, and classic five-pocket durability.', 37.9900, 35.9900, NULL, NULL, 4.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:25', 'en', 'default', 4, 56, '2026-08-01 19:41:25', NULL, 0),
