(241, 'bk-hall-default', 'booking', 'Grand Royal Hall Reservation', 'Grand Royal Hall Reservation', '<p>Reserve the <strong>Grand Royal Hall</strong> for your next event and experience luxury and elegance. Perfect for weddings, conferences, parties, and special occasions, this spacious venue offers top-tier amenities and unmatched service.</p>', '<p>Make your next event unforgettable by booking the <strong>Grand Royal Hall</strong>, a premier venue designed for celebrations of all kinds. Whether you’re hosting a wedding, corporate event, birthday party, or community gathering, the <strong>Grand Royal Hall</strong> provides the perfect setting with its elegant design, spacious layout, and modern amenities.</p><br><p>Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual systems, ample seating arrangements, and customizable décor options, this hall offers everything you need to create a memorable experience. Our dedicated staff ensures a seamless event, from the booking process to the final farewell, allowing you to focus on enjoying the occasion.</p>', 'grand-royal-hall-reservation', 1, 1, 1, 'Grand Royal Banquet Hall – Perfect Venue for Weddings & Events', 'banquet hall booking, wedding venue, corporate event space, party hall rental, luxury banquet hall', 'Book the Grand Royal Banquet Hall for weddings, corporate events, and grand celebrations. Elegant space with premium amenities for a memorable occasion.', 500.0000, 450.0000, NULL, NULL, 0.0000, '2026-08-01 19:41:36', 'en', 'default', 9, 121, '2026-08-01 19:41:37', NULL, 1);
